                      <h3 className="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6 flex items-center">
                        <div className="w-8 h-8 bg-gray-600 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm mr-3">
                          📋
                        </div>
                        More Templates
